# Train model baseline

Sử dụng dataset NAB AWSCloudwatch Dataset

## Tải NAB

```
git clone https://github.com/numenta/NAB.git
# Data cần: NAB/data/realAWSCloudwatch/*.csv
# Label cần: NAB/labels/combined_windows.json
```
## Tạo DB riêng cho NAB
Trong mlops/db, tạo file SQL:
```
-- db/add_nab_table.sql
CREATE TABLE metrics_labeled (
    id BIGSERIAL,
    ts TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    source_file TEXT NOT NULL,
    value DOUBLE PRECISION NOT NULL,
    is_anomaly BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false
);
CREATE INDEX idx_metrics_labeled_file ON metrics_labeled (source_file, ts);
```

Chạy bash tạo database trong Docker Container (timescaledb)
```
docker exec -i timescaledb psql -U mlops -d metrics_db < db/add_nab_table.sql
```
## Script load NAB vào database
Thư viện cần tải thêm: ```pandas, psycopg2-binary```
```
conda install pandas psycopg2-binary
```
Chạy:
```python scripts/load_nab_to_db.py```
